  {
   "id": "hdr_sticky",
   "name": "HEADER",
   "parameters": {
    "content": "# NZAMY · Onboarding & Verification\n\n• **1.1** Welcome (`/new-user`) ✅ • **1.2a** Notify admin: new lawyer (`/verification`) ✅\n• **1.2b** Approval callback (`/lawyer-approval` GET) ✅ **token-guarded** Supabase update\n• **1.3** Firm (`/new-firm`) ✅ • **1.4** Provider (`/new-provider`) ✅\n\n1.2b: append `?user_id=<uuid>&token=<secret>`; token must equal n8n env `NZAMY_APPROVAL_SECRET` (interim guard — use a per-record HMAC before production). Signup `/new-user` still needs a Supabase DB webhook to fire.",
    "height": 300,
    "width": 820
   },
   "position": [
    -80,
    -220
   ],
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1
  },
  {
