   "name": "DELIVERY NOTE",
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## ⚠️ DUMMY delivery\nDeliver nodes POST to `$env.NZAMY_DELIVERY_URL` (placeholder) with `onError: continueRegularOutput`.\n\n**Go live:** point at Evolution WhatsApp / email; resolve recipient email/phone from `to_user_id` via a Supabase lookup.",
